[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780648953","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105051#issuecomment-2780648953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105051","id":2780648953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lvVX5","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T10:27:50Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T10:27:50Z","body":"Did you check that the resulting text is true? The methods seem to be passing in the motion at least:\r\n\r\nIn `GodotPhysicsDirectSpaceState2D::intersect_shape`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4b36c0491edcecb1f800bc59ef2995921999c3c0/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_space_2d.cpp#L240\r\n\r\nIn ` GodotPhysicsDirectSpaceState2D::rest_info`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4b36c0491edcecb1f800bc59ef2995921999c3c0/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_space_2d.cpp#L477\r\n\r\nIn `GodotPhysicsDirectSpaceState2D::collide_shape`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4b36c0491edcecb1f800bc59ef2995921999c3c0/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_space_2d.cpp#L382\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIn turn, the `GodotCollisionSolver2D::solve` method handles some special cases but generically it calls\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4b36c0491edcecb1f800bc59ef2995921999c3c0/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_collision_solver_2d_sat.cpp#L1106\r\n\r\nwhich chooses the right method to call from a table, for example it could call\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4b36c0491edcecb1f800bc59ef2995921999c3c0/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_collision_solver_2d_sat.cpp#L757\r\n\r\nwhich does take the motion into account in some way:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4b36c0491edcecb1f800bc59ef2995921999c3c0/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_collision_solver_2d_sat.cpp#L798-L799\r\n\r\nSo I think this is an actual difference between the 2D and 3D physics engines.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780648953/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780650750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105051#issuecomment-2780650750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105051","id":2780650750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lvVz-","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizat